{"call_id":"eb4a8c8a-c455-4d42-b40a-f5b33fab048b","metadata":{"error_type":null,"finish_reason":"stop","mode":"ok","response_id":"8ae45632f4bd3aca0455f3dc1ba955aa.01a109cd9cfa7100a038696264f7a4a8","status_code":null,"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"cached_tokens":13824,"completion_tokens":1685,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null},"prompt_tokens":17135,"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":13824,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":18820}},"raw_response":{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"logprobs":null,"message":{"annotations":null,"audio":null,"content":"{\"protocol_version\":\"impact-response-v4\",\"action\":\"read\",\"summary\":\"Case-stage 要求将 R1-R3 与每条用例的完整 content_json、execution_notes 及当时编写来源逐条比对。当前输入只固定提供 C2（case_id 171f4a98-7e14-437b-a403-6a3f360b09c0）的完整内容；C1、C3 仅有目录元数据（case_id/version_id/content_hash/version_record_sha256），缺少完整用例 JSON、execution_notes 与 source_refs，无法就 R1 订单保留调整、R2 优惠码删除、R3 订单导出新增判断其验证点与负向条件，也不能用标题或 hash 代替真实内容。先请求读取 C1、C3 的完整固定用例证据，不臆造补齐。部署状态仍为用户声明、未知。\",\"reads\":{\"case_refs\":[\"C1\",\"C3\"]}}","function_call":null,"reasoning":"Let me analyze this task carefully.\n\nThe task is at the \"case_impacts\" stage (coordination_context.stage is \"case_impacts\"). The protocol says:\n\n\"Case stage: compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty.\"\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Compare every R rule (R1, R2, R3) with the complete case JSON, execution_notes, and original sources.\n2. Return rule_ref/case_impacts with literal paths and actual values.\n3. evidence_outcomes is empty.\n\nThe rules are:\n- R1: order_retention_period_change (modified) - 订单保留期从7天变更为9天\n- R2: promo_code_rule_removed (removed) - 删除优惠码规则\n- R3: order_export_rule_added (added) - 新增订单导出规则\n\nThe fixed_case_catalog contains three cases:\n- C1: case_id 0619c395-36ac-4886-878c-a0b74d8bb2b1\n- C2: case_id 171f4a98-7e14-437b-a403-6a3f360b09c0 (this is the \"primary\" case shown in full)\n- C3: case_id 83967531-0da5-4c10-a1bc-4bf452ef7243\n\nHowever, only C2's complete JSON is provided in the `primary` field. C1 and C3 are only listed in the catalog with hashes, but their complete content_json, execution_notes, and original sources are NOT provided in the input. \n\nWait, let me re-read. The `primary` field contains the full case for C2 (171f4a98...). The other cases C1 and C3 are only in `fixed_case_catalog` and `fixed_references.cases`, but their full content is not in this input.\n\nThe protocol says: \"compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources\". For C1 and C3, the complete case JSON is not supplied. \n\nThe skill says: \"原来源缺失、解析不完整和原生成上下文截断均保留，说明它们影响哪些判断，不编造补齐。\"\n\nAlso: \"Declaring analyzed only after its complete evidence was supplied; insufficient/unprocessed must remain explicit.\"\n\nSo for C2 (the primary case), I have complete evidence. For C1 and C3, complete case JSON is missing.\n\nNow, the action for case_impacts stage. Let me think about whether to do \"read\" or \"finish\".\n\nThe instruction says: \"For read return only fixed P/S/C/D reads, no outcome, candidates or evidence_outcomes.\"\n\nSince C1 and C3 complete case JSONs are not provided, I should request reads for them: read case_refs C1 and C3. That's the appropriate action — read.\n\nWait, but can I request case reads? The BoundReadRequest has case_refs field. Yes: \"For read return only fixed P/S/C/D reads\". So I should return action=read with case_refs for C1 and C3.\n\nBut let me consider: should I analyze C2 now and mark finish? The instruction says compare EVERY R rule with complete case JSON. Since not all cases' evidence is supplied, I cannot complete the full case-stage analysis. I should read the missing case evidence first.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says the current stage is \"case_impacts\". The unit (primary) is C2. Hmm, but the scope counts say cases: 3, and there are 3 cases in the catalog. The `primary` is C2. \n\nThe protocol for case stage says: \"compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty.\"\n\nGiven that C1 and C3 complete evidence is not in the input, I need to read them. The action should be \"read\" requesting case_refs [\"C1\", \"C3\"].\n\nLet me construct the read response:\n- protocol_version: \"impact-response-v4\"\n- action: \"read\"\n- reads: { case_refs: [\"C1\",\"C3\"] }\n- summary: explains requesting complete evidence for C1 and C3 before case-stage impact comparison; C2 complete evidence is available.\n- unit_outcome: null (read only)\n- evidence_outcomes: should be empty for read? The instruction says for read return only reads, no outcome, candidates or evidence_outcomes. So evidence_outcomes: [] (or omit? It's required? No, only protocol_version, action, summary are required). But for read, we should not include evidence_outcomes. So omit or empty array.\n\nActually, looking at schema, required: [\"protocol_version\", \"action\", \"summary\"]. So minimal is those three. For read, include reads with case_refs.\n\nLet me double check: \"For read return only fixed P/S/C/D reads, no outcome, candidates or evidence_outcomes.\"\n\nSo reads should contain only fixed P/S/C/D reads. case_refs are C reads. So case_refs: [\"C1\",\"C3\"] is fine.\n\nShould I also request segments/differences? Not needed since we already have the fixed text evidence and discovery is complete. The case stage needs case JSONs for C1 and C3.\n\nLet me write the response.\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider whether to finish with what we have. The environment: deployment_status unknown. The instruction: \"Declaring analyzed only after its complete evidence was supplied; insufficient/unprocessed must remain explicit.\"\n\nSince the case stage requires comparing every R rule with complete case JSON for each case, and we only have C2's complete JSON, we cannot declare the unit as fully analyzed. We must read C1 and C3.\n\nSo action=read, case_refs=[\"C1\",\"C3\"].\n\nLet me formulate a good summary.\n\nSummary: \"Case-stage 分析需要 C1/C3 的完整用例 JSON、execution_notes 及其当时编写来源；当前输入仅提供 C2 的完整内容，C1/C3 只有目录元数据（case_id/version_id/hash），缺少 content_json 与 source_refs，无法判断规则影响。请求读取 C1 与 C3 的完整固定用例证据后继续对比 R1-R3。\"\n\nThat's good. Reads with case_refs [\"C1\",\"C3\"].\n\nI won't include candidates, evidence_outcomes, unit_outcome.\n\nLet me verify the schema constraints:\n- protocol_version const \"impact-response-v4\" ✓\n- action \"read\" ✓\n- summary string minLength 1 ✓\n- reads: BoundReadRequest with case_refs ✓\n\nFinal answer as JSON.","reasoning_content":"Let me analyze this task carefully.\n\nThe task is at the \"case_impacts\" stage (coordination_context.stage is \"case_impacts\"). The protocol says:\n\n\"Case stage: compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty.\"\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Compare every R rule (R1, R2, R3) with the complete case JSON, execution_notes, and original sources.\n2. Return rule_ref/case_impacts with literal paths and actual values.\n3. evidence_outcomes is empty.\n\nThe rules are:\n- R1: order_retention_period_change (modified) - 订单保留期从7天变更为9天\n- R2: promo_code_rule_removed (removed) - 删除优惠码规则\n- R3: order_export_rule_added (added) - 新增订单导出规则\n\nThe fixed_case_catalog contains three cases:\n- C1: case_id 0619c395-36ac-4886-878c-a0b74d8bb2b1\n- C2: case_id 171f4a98-7e14-437b-a403-6a3f360b09c0 (this is the \"primary\" case shown in full)\n- C3: case_id 83967531-0da5-4c10-a1bc-4bf452ef7243\n\nHowever, only C2's complete JSON is provided i